# File Organization

The project root should only contain config files and application directories. New files must go in the correct location:

| File type | Location | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| Markdown docs, guides, notes | `docs/` | Setup guides, troubleshooting, design docs |
| Static data (CSV, JSON datasets) | `data/` | Player lists, stat databases |
| Utility scripts (Python, shell, one-off TS) | `scripts/` | Scrapers, deploy helpers, data converters |
| React components | `components/` | UI components |
| Library / business logic (TS) | `lib/` | AI, parsers, API clients, utilities |
| React hooks | `hooks/` | SWR hooks, custom hooks |
| React contexts | `contexts/` | Providers, context definitions |
| API routes | `app/api/` | Next.js route handlers |
| Unit / component tests | `__tests__/` | Vitest test files |
| E2E tests | `e2e/` | Playwright specs |
| TypeScript types | `types/` | Shared type definitions |
| Static assets (images, icons) | `public/` | Favicons, OG images |

Never place scripts, markdown docs, data files, or non-config files directly in the project root.
